@page "/getting-started"

@* 忠实自源外壳页（纯静态 HTML，无组件依赖）。示例代码中的 Dialog/Button 等标签按改名规则 去掉了 Bb 前缀；片段与最终 API 已核对一致。 *@

<PageTitle>@L.T("快速开始 - Atom BlazorUI", "Getting Started - Atom BlazorUI")</PageTitle>

<div class="space-y-8 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">@L.T("快速开始", "Getting Started")</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground">
            @L.T("学习如何在 Blazor 应用中同时使用 Primitives 与 Components", "Learn how to use primitives and components in your Blazor application")
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("Primitives 与 Components 的差别", "Primitives vs Components")</h2>

            <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="p-5 border rounded-lg space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Primitives</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("无头、无样式的组件，负责行为、无障碍与状态管理。", "Headless, unstyled components that provide behavior, accessibility, and state management.")
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("完全掌控样式", "Full control over styling")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("内置无障碍支持", "Accessibility built-in")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("键盘导航", "Keyboard navigation")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("可用你自己的设计体系", "Use your own design system")</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="p-5 border rounded-lg space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary">Components</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("在 Primitives 外面的预置样式包装件，采用 shadcn/ui 设计与 Tailwind 类。", "Pre-styled wrappers around primitives with shadcn/ui design and Tailwind classes.")
                    </p>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("美观的默认样式", "Beautiful defaults")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("shadcn/ui 风格", "shadcn/ui styling")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("实现快捷", "Quick to implement")</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 mt-0.5">✓</span>
                            <span class="text-muted-foreground">@L.T("支持暗色模式", "Dark mode support")</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("用法示例", "Usage Examples")</h2>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("使用 Component（快速上手）", "Using a Component (Quick Start)")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("直接引入带样式的组件即可使用，默认样式已经就绪：", "Import and use styled components directly with beautiful defaults:")
                    </p>
                    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4">
                        <pre class="text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>@@using AtomBlazor

&lt;Dialog&gt;
    &lt;DialogTrigger&gt;
        &lt;Button&gt;Open Dialog&lt;/Button&gt;
    &lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;
    &lt;DialogContent&gt;
        &lt;DialogHeader&gt;
            &lt;DialogTitle&gt;Dialog Title&lt;/DialogTitle&gt;
            &lt;DialogDescription&gt;Description text&lt;/DialogDescription&gt;
        &lt;/DialogHeader&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Dialog content goes here&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/DialogContent&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("使用 Primitive（自定义样式）", "Using a Primitive (Custom Styling)")</h3>
                    @if (L.IsChinese)
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            想要完全掌控样式时就用 Primitives。Primitives 与 Components 的类型名相同，因此一个文件只引入一个命名空间；
                            也可以把标签写全，例如 <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">AtomBlazor.Primitives.DialogPrimitive</code>。
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    else
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Use primitives when you want full control over styling. Primitives and components
                            share the same type names, so import one namespace per file &mdash; or fully qualify
                            the tags, as <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">AtomBlazor.Primitives.DialogPrimitive</code>.
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4">
                        <pre class="text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>@@using AtomBlazor.Primitives.Dialog

&lt;Dialog&gt;
    &lt;DialogTrigger class="my-custom-button-class"&gt;
        Open Dialog
    &lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;
    &lt;DialogPortal&gt;
        &lt;DialogOverlay class="my-overlay-styles" /&gt;
        &lt;DialogContent class="my-custom-dialog-styles"&gt;
            &lt;DialogTitle class="my-title-styles"&gt;
                Custom Styled Dialog
            &lt;/DialogTitle&gt;
            &lt;p class="my-content-styles"&gt;Fully custom!&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/DialogContent&gt;
    &lt;/DialogPortal&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("组合模式", "Composition Patterns")</h2>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground">
                @L.T("Components 以组合方式搭建——把子组件拼起来即可构成复杂界面。", "Components are built using composition - combine sub-components to create complex UIs.")
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("必需的层级结构", "Required Pattern")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("多数 Primitives 要求固定的组件层级：", "Most primitives require a specific component hierarchy:")
                    </p>
                    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4">
                        <pre class="text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;!-- Root component manages state --&gt;
&lt;Dialog&gt;
    &lt;!-- Trigger opens the dialog --&gt;
    &lt;DialogTrigger&gt;...&lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;

    &lt;!-- Portal renders outside DOM hierarchy --&gt;
    &lt;DialogPortal&gt;
        &lt;!-- Overlay for click-outside behavior --&gt;
        &lt;DialogOverlay /&gt;

        &lt;!-- Content with focus management --&gt;
        &lt;DialogContent&gt;...&lt;/DialogContent&gt;
    &lt;/DialogPortal&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("受控状态", "Controlled State")</h3>
                    @if (L.IsChinese)
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            在父组件用 @@bind- 接管组件状态：
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    else
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Control component state from parent using @@bind-:
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4">
                        <pre class="text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;Dialog @@bind-Open="isDialogOpen"&gt;
    &lt;DialogTrigger&gt;&lt;Button&gt;Open&lt;/Button&gt;&lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;
    &lt;DialogContent&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Controlled by parent component&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;button @@onclick="() => isDialogOpen = false"&gt;
            Close
        &lt;/button&gt;
    &lt;/DialogContent&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;

@@code {
    private bool isDialogOpen = false;
}</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">@L.T("非受控状态", "Uncontrolled State")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("让组件自行管理自己的状态：", "Let the component manage its own state:")
                    </p>
                    <div class="rounded-lg border bg-muted/50 p-4">
                        <pre class="text-sm overflow-x-auto"><code>&lt;Dialog&gt;
    &lt;DialogTrigger&gt;&lt;Button&gt;Open&lt;/Button&gt;&lt;/DialogTrigger&gt;
    &lt;DialogContent&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Component manages its own open/close state&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;DialogClose&gt;&lt;Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline"&gt;Close&lt;/Button&gt;&lt;/DialogClose&gt;
    &lt;/DialogContent&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("常见模式", "Common Patterns")</h2>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary bg-primary/5 rounded-r-lg space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="font-medium">@L.T("级联上下文", "Cascading Context")</h4>
                    @if (L.IsChinese)
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            根组件用 <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CascadingValue</code> 与子组件
                            共享状态。子组件自动接收上下文，无需逐层传递属性。
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    else
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Root components use <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CascadingValue</code> to
                            share state with child components. Child components automatically receive context - no prop drilling needed.
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary bg-primary/5 rounded-r-lg space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="font-medium">@L.T("Portal 渲染", "Portal Rendering")</h4>
                    @if (L.IsChinese)
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Dialog、Popover 这类组件用 <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Portal</code>
                            把内容渲染到父级 DOM 之外，以避开 z-index 问题并支持正确的遮罩层。
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    else
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Components like Dialog and Popover use <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Portal</code>
                            to render outside their parent DOM to avoid z-index issues and enable proper overlays.
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 border-l-4 border-primary bg-primary/5 rounded-r-lg space-y-2">
                    <h4 class="font-medium">@L.T("事件回调", "Event Callbacks")</h4>
                    @if (L.IsChinese)
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            组件会暴露 <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">OpenChanged</code> 这类事件，
                            状态变化时你可以挂上自己的逻辑。
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                    else
                    {
                                        <text>
                                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                            Components expose events like <code class="text-xs bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">OpenChanged</code>
                            that you can hook into for custom logic when state changes.
                        </p>
                                        </text>
}
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("下一步", "Next Steps")</h2>
            <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <a href="/architecture" class="p-5 border rounded-lg hover:bg-accent transition-colors space-y-2 no-underline">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">@L.T("查看架构说明", "View Architecture")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("深入理解两层式架构", "Understand the two-tier architecture in depth")
                    </p>
                </a>
                <a href="/primitives/dialog" class="p-5 border rounded-lg hover:bg-accent transition-colors space-y-2 no-underline">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">@L.T("浏览 Primitives", "Explore Primitives")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("查看 Primitives 演示与代码示例", "See primitive demos with code examples")
                    </p>
                </a>
                <a href="/components/dialog" class="p-5 border rounded-lg hover:bg-accent transition-colors space-y-2 no-underline">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">@L.T("浏览 Components", "Browse Components")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("查看开箱即用的带样式组件", "View styled components ready to use")
                    </p>
                </a>
                <a href="/architecture#accessibility" class="p-5 border rounded-lg hover:bg-accent transition-colors space-y-2 no-underline">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-primary">@L.T("无障碍", "Accessibility")</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                        @L.T("了解内置的无障碍特性", "Learn about built-in accessibility features")
                    </p>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>显示语言快照（MainLayout 级联下发；缺省回落中文）。</summary>
    [CascadingParameter] public DemoCultureState L { get; set; } = DemoCultureState.Default;
}
